---
title: "pause and unpause (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not Legion operator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_action: authorized
    q_check_action --> q_pause: action == pause AND paused == false
    q_check_action --> q_unpause: action == unpause AND paused == true
    q_check_action --> q_revert_state: already in target state
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert InvalidStateTransition
    q_pause --> q_emit_pause: paused = true
    q_emit_pause --> [*]: emit Paused(caller)
    q_unpause --> q_emit_unpause: paused = false
    q_emit_unpause --> [*]: emit Unpaused(caller)

    note right of q_check_action
        INV-001: Only Legion operators can pause/unpause
        INV-002: Paused state blocks invest, refund, claim, and excess withdrawal
        INV-003: Pause does not block admin or emergency operations
    end note
